1
00:00:44,570 --> 00:00:45,480
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,920
[Episode 25]

3
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:47,410
[Adapted from Migu's novel
"Unsoiled Starlight"]

4
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:01:01,850 --> 00:01:02,800
How rare.

6
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:05,680
I thought all your time now

7
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:08,240
belonged to Shu Tinglan.

8
00:01:15,950 --> 00:01:16,760
These photos.

9
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:19,360
It was you that gave them
to my mother, right?

10
00:01:20,510 --> 00:01:21,920
I was that boring?

11
00:01:25,310 --> 00:01:26,130
[Senzhou Bank Transaction Record]

12
00:01:27,090 --> 00:01:28,490
After all, in this world,

13
00:01:28,910 --> 00:01:30,510
the person who hates my wife,

14
00:01:30,870 --> 00:01:33,240
other than you, her half-sister,

15
00:01:33,259 --> 00:01:34,789
there won't be a second one.

16
00:01:35,130 --> 00:01:36,160
Wen Jian.

17
00:01:37,050 --> 00:01:38,400
Enough is enough.

18
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:39,780
Enough?

19
00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:43,080
Why should I?

20
00:01:43,870 --> 00:01:45,720
I just want everything she has

21
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:47,110
to become precarious.

22
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,240
I want every time she gains something

23
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:51,570
to be accompanied
by the fear of losing it.

24
00:01:51,789 --> 00:01:52,680
Why?

25
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,440
Just because of your father?

26
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:57,759
Father?

27
00:02:03,270 --> 00:02:04,970
Does he even deserve the title?

28
00:02:04,970 --> 00:02:07,170
I have never fought for a father's love.

29
00:02:07,380 --> 00:02:09,039
I just want an answer.

30
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,840
I want to know.

31
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,320
Why is it that we

32
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,840
share the same blood,

33
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,820
yet Shu Tinglan is a treasure
out in the open,

34
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:18,240
but me?

35
00:02:18,770 --> 00:02:20,390
From the moment I was born I'm a mistake

36
00:02:20,390 --> 00:02:22,050
that should have been erased.

37
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,000
Wen Jian.

38
00:02:24,370 --> 00:02:26,300
This is not an excuse for you
to hurt others.

39
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:28,210
And Tinglan shouldn't have to bear it.

40
00:02:28,210 --> 00:02:29,390
You also think I'm looking for excuses,

41
00:02:29,390 --> 00:02:30,650
don't you, Zhuo Yu'an?

42
00:02:31,200 --> 00:02:32,040
No.

43
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,760
I'm just walking a path

44
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,290
that was destined long ago.

45
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:36,960
Shu Tinglan, on this path,

46
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,600
is the brightest lamp,

47
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,270
and I'm just a shadow under the lamp

48
00:02:40,270 --> 00:02:41,500
that no one notices.

49
00:02:42,090 --> 00:02:44,000
I just want to try.

50
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,240
If I smash the lamp,

51
00:02:47,030 --> 00:02:48,079
will everyone be able to

52
00:02:48,079 --> 00:02:49,120
see me at a glance?

53
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:53,100
This has nothing to do with me.

54
00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:55,850
And even less to do with her.

55
00:02:59,120 --> 00:02:59,920
See?

56
00:03:00,950 --> 00:03:02,880
You are just like them, Zhuo Yu'an.

57
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,000
Just as cruel.

58
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,560
No difference.

59
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:17,079
Recently, a tech company

60
00:03:17,079 --> 00:03:18,480
hired me as a consultant.

61
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,200
The next time we meet,

62
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,560
we will be competitors.

63
00:03:42,460 --> 00:03:43,440
Dong.

64
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:45,220
This color looks good, right?

65
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:46,240
Yes.

66
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:51,050
Who are you knitting this for?

67
00:03:51,050 --> 00:03:52,600
For Tinglan's future baby.

68
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,120
Dong.

69
00:03:55,540 --> 00:03:57,240
Do you think I will recover

70
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:58,540
from this illness?

71
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,480
Of course!

72
00:04:00,090 --> 00:04:01,200
Once you finish knitting the sweater,

73
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,160
you can give it to

74
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,240
your daughter's baby
when you are discharged.

75
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,900
I'm not leaving the hospital.

76
00:04:06,050 --> 00:04:07,840
I don't want to bother Tinglan.

77
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:27,610
How are the preparations
for the trial going?

78
00:04:28,280 --> 00:04:29,560
I've found some breakthroughs,

79
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:31,490
but I need to verify them one by one.

80
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,150
Not bad.

81
00:04:32,520 --> 00:04:33,320
If you have any questions,

82
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,360
feel free to talk to me anytime.

83
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,159
Okay.

84
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:41,520
This is not just your fault.

85
00:04:41,650 --> 00:04:43,909
Don't put too much pressure on yourself.

86
00:04:44,030 --> 00:04:45,000
After all,

87
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:47,909
this is the first case
I've handled independently.

88
00:04:47,909 --> 00:04:49,080
No matter what,

89
00:04:49,159 --> 00:04:51,290
I will take responsibility to the end.

90
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:53,120
Remember to eat.

91
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:43,000
It's all messed up.

92
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,920
It's unwearable.

93
00:05:46,930 --> 00:05:48,440
It's not knitted right.

94
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:51,010
It's almost done.

95
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,680
Mom.

96
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:55,890
It's ruined.

97
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:56,950
Mom!

98
00:05:57,280 --> 00:05:58,080
It's ruined!

99
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,010
It's okay, it's okay!

100
00:05:59,010 --> 00:06:00,040
-It's unwearable！
-We will buy a new one.

101
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,920
-Mom!
-I need to knit it!

102
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:02,800
Mom, look at me.

103
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,600
I'm Tinglan.

104
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,800
Forget it! Let's buy a new one!

105
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:07,480
-Forget it!
-No! I'll fix it!

106
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:07,960
Mom!

107
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:10,160
-It’s almost done!
-Mom!

108
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,120
I'm Tinglan.

109
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:12,320
Mommy...

110
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:13,960
Mommy.

111
00:06:15,580 --> 00:06:16,230
Mom...

112
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,650
I'm Tinglan.

113
00:06:18,050 --> 00:06:19,000
Tinglan.

114
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,840
We're not staying here anymore.

115
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:21,970
Let's go home, okay?

116
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:25,380
I don't want to go back.

117
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:28,630
Tinglan, Mom is doing fine here.

118
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,060
I don't want to go home.

119
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:32,000
Going home will only burden you.

120
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,520
You're not a burden to me.

121
00:06:33,550 --> 00:06:34,640
Let's go. Let's go home.

122
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:36,240
I don't want to go home.

123
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:50,920
Tinglan.

124
00:07:15,050 --> 00:07:15,680
I'm sorry.

125
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,880
Why are you apologizing?

126
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:24,090
I talked to Wen Jian yesterday.

127
00:07:24,230 --> 00:07:25,360
Maybe I was too harsh

128
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,360
and provoked her,

129
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:28,740
so she came to bother your mother.

130
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,690
This is between me and Wen Jian.

131
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,130
It's not your fault.

132
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:42,680
By the way,

133
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:43,680
Mom said

134
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,640
it's been a long time
since she hung out with me,

135
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:47,300
so she wants to go out to relax.

136
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:48,300
Okay.

137
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,690
I'll walk together.

138
00:07:50,080 --> 00:07:50,600
No need.

139
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,320
You're so busy with work.

140
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,440
We'll only be gone for a day or two.

141
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:56,370
I have a court hearing next Monday.

142
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:57,560
All right.

143
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,380
Be careful on the road.

144
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:01,060
Call me when you get there.

145
00:08:13,280 --> 00:08:14,080
Zhuo Yu'an.

146
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,240
Thank you.

147
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,480
Hello?

148
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:34,200
Is this Miss Shu?

149
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:35,320
Yes.

150
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:37,030
May I ask who is calling?

151
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:38,610
My name is Zhuo Hong.

152
00:08:39,010 --> 00:08:40,440
I'm Yu'an's father.

153
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:45,240
It's okay.

154
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,040
I'm here.

155
00:08:49,010 --> 00:08:50,280
I think

156
00:08:50,430 --> 00:08:52,600
Tinglan is a nice girl.

157
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:55,000
She's capable and innocent.

158
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:58,160
Why do you insist
on opposing her being with our son?

159
00:08:59,350 --> 00:09:00,910
I heard from Wang

160
00:09:00,930 --> 00:09:02,390
that you even sent someone

161
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:04,730
to investigate her friend's company.

162
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:07,060
You're way too involved, aren't you?

163
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,640
You don't understand.

164
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,440
Miss Shu,

165
00:09:22,850 --> 00:09:23,880
didn't I tell you

166
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:24,900
to come alone?

167
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:28,930
When you called her,

168
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,440
I was right there.

169
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,960
I thought it would be more appropriate

170
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,290
for us to come together.

171
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,440
You are Shu Minghai's daughter.

172
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,040
Back then, your father almost dragged

173
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:42,400
half of Zhuo Group into the mud.

174
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:43,760
If I hadn't used

175
00:09:43,790 --> 00:09:45,850
my old connections and last resorts,

176
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,600
the place you're standing right now

177
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:49,600
would have changed hands long ago.

178
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:50,800
Uncle Zhuo.

179
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,080
As for what my father did,

180
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:53,880
I can't

181
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,480
and won't defend him.

182
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,800
But I am me.

183
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:00,840
His blood flows in your veins,

184
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,320
and you have a mentally unstable mother.

185
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:04,900
Miss Shu.

186
00:10:05,510 --> 00:10:07,000
I didn't call you here today

187
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,160
to discuss

188
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:09,920
right and wrong with you.

189
00:10:10,300 --> 00:10:11,760
I just want to tell you

190
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:14,280
that some things can be inherited.

191
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,330
For example,

192
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:18,000
the instinct for treachery.

193
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,140
Uncle Zhuo.

194
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:24,370
I can't choose my background,

195
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,090
but you shouldn't

196
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,680
deny everything about me because of it.

197
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,280
Even if you don't believe me,

198
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,330
you should trust

199
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,690
Zhuo Yu'an's judgment.

200
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:37,800
Our relationship is a choice we both made.

201
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:38,620
You shouldn't

202
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,520
use "doing good for Zhuo Yu'an"
as an excuse

203
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:41,920
to control his life.

204
00:10:42,700 --> 00:10:43,160
I know

205
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:46,540
you're afraid of anything uncontrollable.

206
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:48,280
But this is unfair to us.

207
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,840
You're also a coward.

208
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,200
Sharp-tongued.

209
00:10:52,520 --> 00:10:54,040
Just like your father!

210
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:56,530
Sign the divorce agreement today,

211
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,600
and I'll let go of the past.

212
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:00,620
Do you really think

213
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:02,840
you can control everything about me?

214
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,280
Including my life

215
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,360
and my choices?

216
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:09,000
I spent twenty years

217
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,360
raising you to be someone everyone envies.

218
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:13,600
Now I won't allow anyone to hurt you.

219
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,780
Do you understand?

220
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:19,460
Do you really think
you can do whatever you want?

221
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:22,680
Have you forgotten
how the Zhuo Group came to be?

222
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:24,240
Back then, you were just a poor boy

223
00:11:24,240 --> 00:11:25,240
with nothing to your name.

224
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,640
When you were living off my mom,

225
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:28,380
did you ever consider her feelings?

226
00:11:28,380 --> 00:11:28,780
You...

227
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,540
How can you talk to your dad like that?

228
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:35,570
Zhuo.

229
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:36,320
It's OK.

230
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,420
Calm down.

231
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,410
Zhuo.

232
00:11:39,880 --> 00:11:40,600
Zhuo!

233
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:41,880
What's wrong, Zhuo?

234
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:42,150
Dad!

235
00:11:42,170 --> 00:11:42,920
Zhuo!

236
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:43,880
Your dad...

237
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:45,040
He's not breathing!

238
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:45,640
Doctor!

239
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:46,390
Zhuo!

240
00:11:46,420 --> 00:11:47,720
Zhuo, don't scare me!

241
00:11:48,010 --> 00:11:48,550
Move!

242
00:11:48,570 --> 00:11:49,360
Let me take a look.

243
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:49,760
Zhuo...

244
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:51,820
-Don’t scare me.
-Hello, is this 120?

245
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,840
-Someone is having a heart attack here.
-Zhuo...

246
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:56,440
-Please come here right now.
-Wake up! Wake up!

247
00:11:58,690 --> 00:11:59,130
[Blessing Peace]

248
00:11:59,130 --> 00:12:02,660
[0707]

249
00:12:02,230 --> 00:12:03,120
Be careful.

250
00:12:03,830 --> 00:12:05,430
Are you feeling a bit better?

251
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,400
It's okay.
